# official-worker local artifacts.
#
# Everything here accumulated during production incident work and is never an
# input to a build, an image or a test. Added 2026-09-08 after a cleanup that
# removed ~55 such files from the working tree.

# One-off live-site probe scripts. Each was written to debug a single source
# against the real government site; all are superseded by test/ and the
# workflow FSMs, and none is imported by src/, the Dockerfile or an npm
# script.
debug-*.ts
debug-*.mjs

# Pre-refactor copies kept by hand during the Browserless -> local Chromium
# migration. The real history is in git.
*.pre-consolidation
*.bak

# Compiled output of `npm run test:build`.
.tstest-build/

# NOTE: extensions/human-assist/ is REQUIRED production content and is
# deliberately tracked. Only the two upstream artifacts the sanitizer strips
# are ignored, in extensions/.gitignore.
